    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in the opposing player's Shooting phase, right after an enemy unit selects its targets. Pick 2 units of yours:\n\n- a **HERETIC ASTARTES** unit picked as the target of at least one of those attacks\n- a **DAMNED** unit no more than 3\" from it, **visible** to both it and the attacking unit\n\nFor the rest of the phase, as long as the **DAMNED** unit remains on the battlefield, check each attack against the **HERETIC ASTARTES** unit when it reaches its **Wound roll**. If the attacking model can see the **DAMNED** unit and could legally target it with that attack, no Wound roll is made; the **DAMNED** unit suffers **mortal wounds** equal to that attack's Damage instead.",
